en...\r\nC:\\Users\\Onur\\Desktop\\FreyaHackathon\\build-the-builder\\out\\final-20261011-181035\\sources\\14-sources-emails-attachmen...\r\nC:\\Users\\Onur\\Desktop\\FreyaHackathon\\build-the-builder\\out\\final-20261011-181035\\sources\\15-sources-meetings-2026-10...\r\nC:\\Users\\Onur\\Desktop\\FreyaHackathon\\build-the-builder\\out\\final-20261011-181035\\sources\\16-statement-debt-call-flow...\r\nC:\\Users\\Onur\\Desktop\\FreyaHackathon\\build-the-builder\\out\\final-20261011-181035\\sources\\17-test-environment-test-cu...\r\nC:\\Users\\Onur\\Desktop\\FreyaHackathon\\build-the-builder\\out\\final-20261011-181035\\sources\\18-test-environment-test-cu...\r\n\r\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
